  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb — follows standard endings in every tense, no exceptions.",
    "*Un duro revés arruinó su vida hace veinte años.* (\"A harsh setback ruined his life twenty years ago.\")",
    "*No quiero arruinar la sorpresa.* (\"I don't want to ruin the surprise.\")",
    "Related: *la ruina* (ruin, noun), *arruinarse* (reflexive, \"to go bankrupt / to be ruined\"), *destrozar* (near-synonym, \"to destroy/wreck\")."
